---
// /hearth: a calm, editorial landing page. The heart of it is one hand-drawn kitchen island, painted in
// thousands of hatch strokes by src/lib/hearth, that turns through the four moments of one meal.
const B = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
const STRIPE_LINK = 'https://donate.stripe.com/REPLACE_ME';
const MAIL = 'mailto:info@freemealsonwheels.com';
const stops = ['Cook', 'Pack', 'Deliver', 'Share'];
const steps = [
  { n: '1', h: 'We cook', p: 'On Saturday mornings volunteers cook fresh meals together in our San Jose and San Ramon kitchens.' },
  { n: '2', h: 'We pack', p: 'Every meal is packed by hand and checked, so it is still hot when it leaves the kitchen.' },
  { n: '3', h: 'We deliver', p: 'Meals are carried to neighbors across both cities and handed over at the door, between 11 AM and 1 PM.' },
];
const involved = [
  { id: 'volunteer', h: 'Volunteer', p: 'Pick a Saturday shift. Choose a kitchen, a date and a role, and your spot is confirmed instantly.', cta: 'Sign up to volunteer', href: `${B}hearth/volunteer` },
  { id: 'meal', h: 'Get a meal', p: 'A fresh, hot meal, free for anyone who needs one. Email us your name, address and household size and we will add you to a route.', cta: 'Request a meal', href: `${B}hearth/get-a-meal` },
  { id: 'donate', h: 'Donate', p: '$10 covers a fresh, hot meal, and every penny goes to food. One-time or monthly, and tax-deductible.', cta: 'Donate securely', href: `${B}hearth/donate` },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Free Meals on Wheels: dignity starts with a full belly</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Free Meals on Wheels cooks and delivers fresh, free meals to neighbors every Saturday across San Jose and San Ramon." />
  <script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add('js')</script>
  <link rel="icon" href={`${B}logo.png`} />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300..600;1,9..144,300..600&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="nav">
    <a class="brand" href={`${B}hearth`}>Free Meals on Wheels</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <a href={`${B}hearth/about`}>Our story</a>
      <a href={`${B}hearth/volunteer`}>Volunteer</a>
      <a href={`${B}hearth/get-a-meal`}>Get a meal</a>
      <a href={`${B}hearth/contact`}>Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="donate" href={`${B}hearth/donate`}>Donate</a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="top">
      <canvas id="h-sky" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>Dignity starts with <em>a full belly.</em></h1>
        <p class="sub">Fresh meals, cooked the same morning and delivered by hand, still warm.</p>
        <div class="btns"><a class="btn dark" href={`${B}hearth/donate`}>Donate</a><a class="btn ghost" href={`${B}hearth/get-a-meal`}>Get a meal</a></div>
      </div>

      <figure class="stage">
        <div id="h-island" class="island is-wash">
          <div id="h-wash" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <canvas id="h-cv" role="img" aria-label="A hand-drawn community kitchen before dawn."></canvas>
          <canvas id="h-act" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
          <canvas id="h-live" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        </div>
        <figcaption id="h-cap" class="cap" aria-live="polite">Before the city wakes, a kitchen light comes on and the first pot goes up.</figcaption>
        <div class="turn">
          <div id="h-scrub" class="scrub" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="Turn through the story of one meal" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuemax="4" aria-valuenow="1" aria-valuetext="Cook, step 1 of 4">
            <span class="track"></span>
            {stops.map((_, i) => <span class="tick" style={`left:${(i / 3) * 100}%`}></span>)}
            <span id="h-handle" class="handle" style="--p:0"></span>
          </div>
          <ol class="stops">
            {stops.map((s, i) => <li style={`left:${(i / 3) * 100}%`}><button type="button" class={`h-stop${i === 0 ? ' on' : ''}`} data-i={i}>{s}</button></li>)}
          </ol>
          <div class="turn-row">
            <span class="hint">Drag to turn</span>
            <span class="arrows">
              <button id="h-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous moment">&larr;</button>
              <button id="h-next" type="button" aria-label="Next moment">&rarr;</button>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="story">
      <div class="wrap two">
        <div class="rv">
          <h2>One Saturday, told slowly.</h2>
          <p class="lede">Free Meals on Wheels cooks and delivers fresh meals to neighbors every week. A Saturday begins with a light in the kitchen and ends with more people at the table than there were at dawn.</p>
          <p>No forms, no questions, no one asking why. A fresh, hot meal is handed over, still warm. At Thanksgiving everyone gets a seat. When it turns cold we pair a hot meal with a warm blanket. A good meal is better shared, and we are all neighbors here.</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="facts rv">
          <div><dt>400+</dt><dd>volunteers cooking and packing</dd></div>
          <div><dt>300+</dt><dd>meals every week</dd></div>
          <div><dt>100%</dt><dd>of every donation goes to food</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="sm">Saturdays</dt><dd>San Jose and San Ramon</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap quote rv">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;A fresh, hot, and nutritious meal is not just satiating, but more importantly, enabling and liberating.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <p>Japjot Sethi and Devinder Kumar started cooking because no neighbor should go to bed hungry.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="how">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="rv">How it works</h2>
        <ol class="rows">
          {steps.map((s) => (
            <li class="row rv"><span class="num">{s.n}</span><h3>{s.h}</h3><p>{s.p}</p></li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="involved">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="rv">Come to the table</h2>
        <ul class="rows">
          {involved.map((c) => (
            <li class="row act rv" id={c.id}><h3>{c.h}</h3><p>{c.p}</p><a class="arrow" href={c.href}>{c.cta}<span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="fine rv">First time volunteering? Wear closed-toe shoes, tie back long hair and arrive 10 minutes early. Coming as a group of 7 or more? <a href={`${MAIL}?subject=Group%20volunteering`}>Email us</a>. Can&rsquo;t get out? Dial 211 for food, housing and health services near you. Payments by Stripe. We are a 501(c)(3).</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="contact">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="rv">Contact</h2>
        <ul class="rows">
          <li class="row rv"><h3>Email</h3><p><a href={MAIL}>info@freemealsonwheels.com</a></p></li>
          <li class="row rv"><h3>Follow along</h3><p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/freemealsonwheels/">Instagram</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.facebook.com/Freemeals20/">Facebook</a></p></li>
          <li class="row rv"><h3>Bring your team</h3><p>Cook and pack together on a Saturday. Great for companies, schools and clubs. <a href={`${MAIL}?subject=Corporate%20team%20day`}>Corporate team days</a></p></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="foot">
    <canvas id="h-foot" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="wrap fgrid">
      <div>
        <p class="fb">Free Meals on Wheels</p>
        <p>A 501(c)(3) nonprofit. Fresh meals every Saturday from San Jose and San Ramon.</p>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={`${B}hearth/about`}>About</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${B}hearth/about#programs`}>Programs</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${B}hearth/get-a-meal`}>Resources</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${B}hearth/my-shifts`}>Log in</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    import { boot } from '../lib/hearth';
    boot();
  </script>
</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root { --paper: #f6f1e6; --ink: #2a211c; --soft: #4a3f36; --text: #35291f; --rule: rgba(42, 33, 28, 0.14); --red: #a8382b; --serif: 'Fraunces', 'Iowan Old Style', Georgia, serif; --sans: Figtree, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-transform: none; }
  a { color: inherit; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; margin: 0; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  button { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
  .wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }

  /* nav: plain HTML, visible at once */
  .nav { position: absolute; z-index: 10; inset: 0 0 auto 0; background: linear-gradient(var(--paper) 0, rgba(246, 241, 230, 0.9) 60%, rgba(246, 241, 230, 0)); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; padding: 18px 36px; }
  .brand { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-right: auto; }
  .nav nav { display: flex; gap: 28px; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 500; }
  .nav nav a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); transition: color 0.15s; }
  .nav nav a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .donate { background: var(--red); color: #fbf3e4; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px 20px; border-radius: 7px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.15s; }
  .donate:hover { background: #8f2d22; }

  /* hero */
  .hero { position: relative; padding: 92px 0 20px; background: linear-gradient(#eef0e8 0, #f2efe3 30%, var(--paper) 64%); overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate; }
  #h-sky { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; height: min(95vh, 900px); min-height: 700px; z-index: -2; -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0, rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 50%, #000 64%, transparent 96%); mask-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0, rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 50%, #000 64%, transparent 96%); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1.4s ease; pointer-events: none; }
  #h-sky.on { opacity: 1; }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; text-align: center; padding: 0 24px; }
  .hero-copy::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -48px; width: min(1180px, 100%); height: calc(100% + 96px); transform: translateX(-50%); background: radial-gradient(ellipse closest-side, rgba(246, 241, 230, 0.95) 58%, rgba(246, 241, 230, 0)); z-index: -1; pointer-events: none; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 5.6vw, 80px); line-height: 1.04; font-weight: 350; font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144; max-width: 16em; margin: 0 auto; }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; }
  .sub { font-size: clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px); color: var(--soft); margin: 14px auto 0; max-width: 40em; line-height: 1.55; text-wrap: balance; }
  .btns { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 26px; border-radius: 7px; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: transform 0.15s, background 0.15s; }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn.dark { background: #211a16; color: #f6f1e6; }
  .btn.dark:hover { background: #3a2c24; }
  .btn.ghost { border-color: rgba(42, 33, 28, 0.35); }
  .btn.ghost:hover { background: rgba(42, 33, 28, 0.05); }

  .stage { position: relative; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; }
  .island { position: relative; width: min(1080px, 100%); margin: 0 auto -10px; aspect-ratio: 1400 / 660; cursor: grab; touch-action: pan-y; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
  .island.drag { cursor: grabbing; }
  #h-cv, #h-act, #h-live { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; display: block; transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1); }
  .island.drag #h-cv, .island.drag #h-act { transition: none; }
  #h-live { mix-blend-mode: screen; pointer-events: none; }
  #h-wash { position: absolute; inset: 6% 4% 2%; border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.9s ease;
    background: radial-gradient(60% 56% at 50% 56%, rgba(133, 160, 140, 0.34), rgba(214, 201, 160, 0.18) 55%, rgba(246, 241, 230, 0) 78%); animation: wash 2.6s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  .island.is-painting #h-wash, .island.is-done #h-wash { opacity: 0; animation: none; }
  @keyframes wash { from { transform: scale(0.97); opacity: 0.8; } to { transform: scale(1.02); opacity: 1; } }

  .cap { position: relative; text-align: center; font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 350; font-size: clamp(18px, 1.55vw, 21px); color: #231a14; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; min-height: 1.5em; max-width: 60em; line-height: 1.4; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
  .cap.swap { opacity: 0; }

  .turn { width: min(520px, 86vw); margin: 8px auto 0; }
  .scrub { position: relative; height: 26px; margin: 0 28px; cursor: pointer; touch-action: none; outline: none; }
  .track { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 12px; height: 2px; background: rgba(42, 33, 28, 0.5); }
  .tick { position: absolute; top: 9px; width: 1.5px; height: 7px; background: rgba(42, 33, 28, 0.55); transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .handle { position: absolute; top: 5px; left: calc(var(--p) * 100%); width: 12px; height: 16px; margin-left: -6px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--red); transition: left 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(168, 56, 43, 0.12); }
  .scrub.drag .handle { transition: none; }
  .scrub:focus-visible .handle { box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(168, 56, 43, 0.35); }
  .stops { list-style: none; margin: 0 28px; padding: 0; position: relative; height: 26px; }
  .stops li { position: absolute; top: 0; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .h-stop { background: none; border: 0; padding: 2px 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); border-radius: 4px; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .h-stop:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .h-stop.on { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .turn-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 2px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); }
  .arrows { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
  .arrows button { background: none; border: 0; width: 38px; height: 34px; font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--text); }
  .arrows button:hover { color: var(--ink); background: rgba(42, 33, 28, 0.06); }

  /* editorial sections */
  .sec { padding: 96px 0 8px; }
  .sec h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 46px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 350; margin-bottom: 34px; }
  .two { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr; gap: 72px; align-items: start; }
  .lede { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 25px); line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 350; color: #3a2f28; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .two p { color: #35291f; }
  .facts { margin: 8px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .facts > div { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 18px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .facts dt { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 38px; font-weight: 350; min-width: 132px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .facts dt.sm { font-size: 27px; }
  .facts dd { margin: 0; color: var(--soft); font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .quote { margin-top: 70px; text-align: center; max-width: 780px; }
  .quote blockquote { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 34px); line-height: 1.32; }
  .quote p { margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--soft); font-size: 15px; }
  .rows { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px 240px 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: baseline; padding: 26px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .row h3 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; }
  .row p { margin: 0; color: #35291f; max-width: 38em; }
  .row .num { font-family: var(--serif); color: var(--red); font-size: 22px; }
  .row.act, #contact .row { grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr auto; }
  #contact .row { grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr; }
  .arrow { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15.5px; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--red); padding-bottom: 2px; }
  .arrow span { display: inline-block; margin-left: 8px; transition: transform 0.2s; }
  .arrow:hover span { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .fine { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--soft); margin: 22px 0 0; max-width: 46em; }
  .row p a, .fine a { text-decoration-color: rgba(168, 56, 43, 0.5); text-underline-offset: 3px; }

  .rv { opacity: 1; }
  .js .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease; }
  .js .rv.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

  /* footer: grass grows up from the bottom edge, behind the content */
  .foot { position: relative; margin-top: 110px; padding: 54px 0 250px; overflow: hidden; }
  #h-foot { position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: 100%; height: 350px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1.2s ease; pointer-events: none; }
  #h-foot.on { opacity: 1; }
  .fgrid { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 40px; align-items: start; }
  .fb { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .foot p { margin: 0; color: #35291f; max-width: 26em; font-size: 15.5px; }
  .foot ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; gap: 26px; font-size: 15px; }
  .foot ul a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--soft); }
  .foot ul a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .two { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
    .row, .row.act { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }
    #contact .row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
    .row .num { display: none; }
    .arrow { justify-self: start; margin-top: 8px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .nav { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 14px; padding: 12px 16px 6px; }
    .nav nav { order: 3; width: 100%; gap: 20px; font-size: 14.5px; overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; }
    .brand { font-size: 19px; }
    .donate { padding: 7px 16px; }
    .hero { padding-top: 108px; }
    .island { aspect-ratio: 690 / 660; }
    .cap { min-height: 4.2em; }
    .sec { padding-top: 72px; }
    .fgrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    .foot { padding-bottom: 230px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    #h-wash { animation: none; }
    .js .rv { transition: none; opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }
</style>
